      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُبَالَهَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>showing stupidity [in an action</i>
or <i>in one's actions,</i> i. e. the <i>acting stupidly,] with
any one.</i> (KL.) [You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بالههُ</span> <i>He acted stupidly,</i>
or <i>in the manner of him who is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْلَه</span>, <i>with
him.</i>]

